WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Binary-only: picinfo is an uninstrumented Linux ELF with a planted NULL read. It takes a file argument; seeds come from a folder.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.100
AFL++ QEMU mode fuzzes it in the sandbox for one minute (sped up 10x).

3
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:45.100
173,393 executions and one distinct finding: SEGV, confirmed by replay.

4
00:00:45.100 --> 00:01:13.100
Stack frames as module offsets, and an issue drafted from the finding.
